 Before concluding, we record several immediate consequences of the above analysis (in addition to the proof of Corollary 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "cor:davis-kahan-conclusion-corollary"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"

