\begin_inset Formula $ \sigma \sqrt{n} \leq \frac{1-1/\sqrt{2}}{5} |\lambda_r^{\star}|$
\end_inset

 , we have — with probability 
\begin_inset Formula $1-O(n^{-8})$
\end_inset

 — that 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{align}
		|\lambda_{i}| & \leq\|\bm{E}\|\leq5\sigma\sqrt{\log n}, 
		\qquad 
		\text{for all }i\geq r+1.
		\label{eq:lambda-i-bound-E-denoising}
