where the first relation is the triangle inequality. This combined with Lemma XXX finishes the proof of the first part. Regarding the second part, i.e.
\begin_inset space ~

\end_inset

the bound on the Frobenius norm, we make the observation that 
\begin_inset Formula $\bm{U}\bm{\Sigma}\bm{V}^{\top}-\bm{M}^{\star}$
\end_inset

 has rank at most 
\begin_inset Formula $2r$
\end_inset

, which immediately implies 
\begin_inset Formula \[
\|\bm{U}\bm{\Sigma}\bm{V}^{\top}-\bm{M}^{\star}\|_{\mathrm{F}}\leq\sqrt{2r}\|\bm{U}\bm{\Sigma}\bm{V}^{\top}-\bm{M}^{\star}\|\lesssim\sqrt{\frac{\mu r^{2}}{n_{1}p}\log n_{2}}\sigma_{1}(\bm{M}^{\star}).
\]
\end_inset

This completes the proof of the second part. 
